<div class="mandarin-hanzi">学生</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">xuésheng</div>

''Meaning:'' student  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
学生在教室里读书。 — Xuésheng zài jiàoshì lǐ dúshū. — The student is reading in the classroom.

!! Usage note
A student or pupil. The second syllable is usually neutral; compare 学校 (xuéxiào, 'school').
